      "units": [
        {
          "id": "m11p20-andrew-exp-s01-c1-f706360d788e",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "The app writes log events to CloudWatch Logs. Streams sit inside a log group, where you set access and retention. Those settings decide who can use the records and how long the records remain available.",
          "text_sha256": "f706360d788e274617c6b483eace893a94c3794480284eda6f2d6842e8e22674",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "f706360d788e274617c6b483eace893a94c3794480284eda6f2d6842e8e22674",
          "asset_sha256": "4879f82881acc993cd23e671fce7fdfdce0f69f8ca37ad59e8e7c9fbdbcd797a"
        },
        {
          "id": "m11p20-andrew-exp-s01-c2-36699100b956",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "Use Logs Insights to explore stored events, metrics and alarms to detect a signal, and a subscription filter when another service needs the matching events delivered.",
          "text_sha256": "36699100b9566e1db6c24fc06a6be4d13cee6bf2306b77fccfbad8aa1a8c90ab",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "36699100b9566e1db6c24fc06a6be4d13cee6bf2306b77fccfbad8aa1a8c90ab",
          "asset_sha256": "4879f82881acc993cd23e671fce7fdfdce0f69f8ca37ad59e8e7c9fbdbcd797a"
        },
        {
          "id": "m11p20-andrew-exp-s02-c1-dbb0aa3525e7",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "If the goal is searchable logs with low delay, subscribe to the supported OpenSearch path shown here. The Lambda shipper sends the events to OpenSearch. Check permission, retries, and destination capacity.",
          "text_sha256": "dbb0aa3525e7529cd0f954dea62d6cbd4c74137b6d951724be74bb4a6b911f53",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "dbb0aa3525e7529cd0f954dea62d6cbd4c74137b6d951724be74bb4a6b911f53",
          "asset_sha256": "e222a35b5baa4c5e764c009478f3e5df9cbe464cd085d41a5b38c908cee47033"
        },
        {
          "id": "m11p20-andrew-exp-s02-c2-260572100871",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "If the goal is a buffered landing in S three, a subscription can send CloudWatch Logs events to Firehose. Firehose batches delivery to S three. Choose buffering that fits when the next process needs the logs.",
          "text_sha256": "26057210087138c50ea452f296403eafbc9c0c3bec1a641036aaad8c699742f6",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "d80e68f1b2b3d9a86ed5e28250267a3c576eebb7faf2e55d6810f79dbdcdac2e",
          "asset_sha256": "e222a35b5baa4c5e764c009478f3e5df9cbe464cd085d41a5b38c908cee47033"
        },
        {
          "id": "m11p20-andrew-exp-s02-c3-b6443336bcba",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "Could that same Firehose stream send these CloudWatch Logs straight to OpenSearch? No. CloudWatch bundles multiple events into one Firehose record, so use the supported search path instead. Verify collection and delivery on either route.",
          "text_sha256": "b6443336bcba00e84565677ec247a20519b9ed32d649e3291ff3e7afc460c2b2",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "b6443336bcba00e84565677ec247a20519b9ed32d649e3291ff3e7afc460c2b2",
          "asset_sha256": "e222a35b5baa4c5e764c009478f3e5df9cbe464cd085d41a5b38c908cee47033"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
